{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41669","headline":"赠漳州张怡使君 · 陈陶","name":"赠漳州张怡使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧德徐方天下闻，当年熊轼继清芬。\n井田异政光蛮竹，符节深恩隔瘴云。\n已见嘉祥生北户，尝嫌夷貊蠹南薰。\n几时徴拜征西越，学着缦胡从使君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}